{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-10-57","kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：二项无理线段与无理线段与比例","englishTitle":"If an area be contained by a rational straight line and the fourth binomial, the side of the area is the irrational straight line called major.","book":10,"number":57,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.57","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.57/","group":"prop_2","sourceNumber":57,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-10-57@raw-ab1bb7bfc79b43ac","contentId":"euclid-10-57","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ab1bb7bfc79b43ac99ace91d0ca5eeae576ce3d71f9fdbbeca5119b3597351b0","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-10-57.statement","euclid-10-57.construction.1","euclid-10-57.proof.1","euclid-10-57.construction.2","euclid-10-57.construction.3","euclid-10-57.proof.2","euclid-10-57.proof.3","euclid-10-57.proof.4","euclid-10-57.proof.5","euclid-10-57.proof.6","euclid-10-57.proof.7","euclid-10-57.proof.8","euclid-10-57.proof.9","euclid-10-57.conclusion","euclid-10-57.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-10-57.statement","contentId":"euclid-10-57","revisionId":"euclid-10-57@raw-ab1bb7bfc79b43ac","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"414c5f5f3dbe3ae438585e51250aff7290c1bc7d751dd981f110daf9422c2385","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If an area be contained by a rational straight line and the fourth binomial, the side of the area is the irrational straight line called major."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果一个区域由有理线段和4 二项无理线段组成,则该区域的另一边是无理线段称为主要区域。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-57.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-10-57","revisionId":"euclid-10-57@raw-ab1bb7bfc79b43ac","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"137e0b444159586d1d9a90150d630006f447bc709b86e6f285cd4205d1eea2cf","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let the area AC be contained by the rational straight line AB and the fourth binomial AD divided into its terms at E, of which terms let AE be the greater; I say that the side of the area AC is the irrational straight line called major."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AC区由有理线段 AB组成,第4 二项无理线段 AD分为E,其中AE为较大数量;我说,AC区是无理线段个称为主要地区。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-57.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-10-57","revisionId":"euclid-10-57@raw-ab1bb7bfc79b43ac","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"12b38c2c72759ae0212507190a84c1091bcf6ff042f2e6fdba50a52a8bba629e","citations":["euclid-10-def-8"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, since AD is a fourth binomial straight line, therefore AE, ED are rational straight lines commensurable in square only, the square on AE is greater than the square on ED by the square on a straight line incommensurable with AE, and AE is commensurable in length with AB. [[X. Deff. II. 4](/principles/euclid-10-def-8)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因为AD是第四条二项无理线段直线,因此AE条ED有理线段 平方可公度而长度不可公度,AE正方形比ED正方形不可公度AE不可公度多,AE条AB条AB。 [[X. Deff. II. 4](/principles/euclid-10-def-8)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-57.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-10-57","revisionId":"euclid-10-57@raw-ab1bb7bfc79b43ac","order":3,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b9d6ce88d68955f2b9dc8cd698d71eedc5cc80f90756b06dbe206aaf207a57cd","citations":["euclid-10-18"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let DE be bisected at F, and let there be applied to AE a parallelogram, the rectangle AG, GE, equal to the square on EF; therefore AG is incommensurable in length with GE. [[X. 18](/principles/euclid-10-18)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"DE两部分为F,对AEa平行四边形适用,矩形、AG、GE,等于EF正方形;因此,AG不可公度GE。 [[X. 18](/principles/euclid-10-18)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-57.construction.3","contentId":"euclid-10-57","revisionId":"euclid-10-57@raw-ab1bb7bfc79b43ac","order":4,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"57c63ced57c8ad86b0284b16d11cda25f18c8b3c127a157ded04e361e1b99d7a","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let GH, EK, FL be drawn parallel to AB, and let the rest of the construction be as before; it is then manifest that MO is the side of the area AC."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让GH,EK,FL与AB平行,让其余建筑与以前一样;然后,MO是AC地区的一面。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-57.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-10-57","revisionId":"euclid-10-57@raw-ab1bb7bfc79b43ac","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e538f512914eb5e0aca7db77ed1ab5ef630624822d8ec26f285c1ea6b34d231d","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"It is next to be proved that MO is the irrational straight line called major."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"下一步是证明MO是无理线段号少校。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-57.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-10-57","revisionId":"euclid-10-57@raw-ab1bb7bfc79b43ac","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"cbb0969ec36b38cc7305921bf8528fb04df2f9699912112e7c8770573888605e","citations":["euclid-6-1","euclid-10-11"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Since AG is incommensurable with EG, AH is also incommensurable with GK, that is, SN with NQ; [[VI. 1](/principles/euclid-6-1), [X. 11](/principles/euclid-10-11)] therefore MN, NO are incommensurable in square."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"由于AG,EG,AH,不可公度,GK,SN,NQ,MN,正方形,NO,不可公度。 [ [VI. 1](/principles/euclid-6-1) [X. 11](/principles/euclid-10-11)"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-57.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-10-57","revisionId":"euclid-10-57@raw-ab1bb7bfc79b43ac","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"916ede615308f4a9b18ba0d55d4faa49485fb426a49fa49100c6465f7db0d472","citations":["euclid-10-19"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since AE is commensurable with AB, AK is rational; [[X. 19](/principles/euclid-10-19)] and it is equal to the squares on MN, NO; therefore the sum of the squares on MN, NO is also rational."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AE是可公度,AB,AK是有理,MN等于正方形,NO,因此MN,NO和正方形的合计数也是有理。 [[X. 19](/principles/euclid-10-19)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-57.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-10-57","revisionId":"euclid-10-57@raw-ab1bb7bfc79b43ac","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e68d0bd2950c0c5216b456602b6f44946d45366588915eb3d0b7b6a0cef37a29","citations":["euclid-10-13"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since DE is incommensurable in length with AB, that is, with EK, while DE is commensurable with EF, therefore EF is incommensurable in length with EK. [[X. 13](/principles/euclid-10-13)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"DE是不可公度,AB,EK,DE是可公度,EF是不可公度,EK。 [[X. 13](/principles/euclid-10-13)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-57.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-10-57","revisionId":"euclid-10-57@raw-ab1bb7bfc79b43ac","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e2d27e8ab6f598ded0e0dd0c29e007d3006eb844d0b6894d812f0ff125e99085","citations":["euclid-10-21"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore EK, EF are rational straight lines commensurable in square only; therefore LE, that is, MR, is medial. [[X. 21](/principles/euclid-10-21)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,EK,EF是有理线段,平方可公度而长度不可公度;LE,即MR,是中项无理线段。 [[X. 21](/principles/euclid-10-21)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-57.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-10-57","revisionId":"euclid-10-57@raw-ab1bb7bfc79b43ac","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f4ac75e3909de930679f99394df782b0c73e38d0428f2a955edc641716d4e9b5","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And it is contained by MN, NO; therefore the rectangle MN, NO is medial."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"由MN,NO组成, 因此矩形,MN,NO是中项无理线段。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-57.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-10-57","revisionId":"euclid-10-57@raw-ab1bb7bfc79b43ac","order":11,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e114128dc6405b4f9a4a1ef98ca1dd4af1f34eba6d0a1bdd8dd69e0521a0d63b","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And the [sum] of the squares on MN, NO is rational, and MN, NO are incommensurable in square."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"正方形对MN,NO的[总 是有理,MN,NO是正方形；上述对应量不可公度。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-57.proof.9","contentId":"euclid-10-57","revisionId":"euclid-10-57@raw-ab1bb7bfc79b43ac","order":12,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 9","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"bd971b648c869ab7238a4a76706d09a8a3bd2193dc151576355663a5ece4c8a7","citations":["euclid-10-39"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, if two straight lines incommensurable in square and making the sum of the squares on them rational, but the rectangle contained by them medial, be added together, the whole is irrational and is called major. [[X. 39](/principles/euclid-10-39)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,如果正方形的不可公度线 和正方形的有理线 和矩形的总数 被加在一起, 整个是无理线,被称为主要线；这里涉及中项无理量。 [[X. 39](/principles/euclid-10-39)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-57.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-10-57","revisionId":"euclid-10-57@raw-ab1bb7bfc79b43ac","order":13,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5b9fae8a3eddc62c2af394fa69ad959049eb60d05a6e1c655d5a51077186cb28","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore MO is the irrational straight line called major and is the side of the area AC. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,MO是无理线段,被称为少校,是AC、Q、D区域。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-57.source","contentId":"euclid-10-57","revisionId":"euclid-10-57@raw-ab1bb7bfc79b43ac","order":14,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"07d72152eba40e2568050980dcf800d784447573b9ef7f1b65f41e1fc14df716","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath sou